# Git-ignored files copied into every new worktree. Git-ignore syntax.
#
# The local signing configs carry the stable `AngryKeyboard Dev` and
# `AngryKeyboard Production` identities. Without them a worktree falls
# back to the ad-hoc default, whose signature changes on every build, so
# macOS drops the Input Monitoring grant. See README "Local signing".
Config/*.local.xcconfig
